==Northern Sami==

===Etymology===
From Finno-Volgaic ''*yärvä'', perhaps a borrowing from {{etyl|ine|-}}. Compare also {{etyl|et|-}} {{term|järv|lang=et}}, {{etyl|fi|-}} {{term|järvi|lang=fi}}, {{etyl|krl|-}} {{term|järvi|lang=krl}}, {{etyl|lv|-}} and {{etyl|lt|-}} {{term|jūra|lang=lv}}.

